<description>&lt;p&gt;Somalia is screening travelers after Kenya confirmed an imported Ebola case while hosting regional talks in Egypt with Eritrea, Sudan and its own officials to coordinate security amid Ethiopia-Eritrea tensions. The federal government is deepening defence ties with Pakistan, seeking JF‑17 fighter jets and securing the release of four Pakistani sailors from Somali pirates. Somali forces killed two al-Shabaab militants in the Bay region and a military court linked a father’s killing to the 2017 Mogadishu bombing case; the lower house passed a long-delayed anti-rape bill and a market shooting in Garowe left two dead and four wounded. The conflict caused 2,284 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMihAFBVV95cUxOOW95azVxaFQ4QXpKOWFZbGx1bGVxQ2FCR3pVQ0VhellxblN6STRwYUlfQnR5cFo0NDNpcUo2S0I3NnVrUF9Xby1UeHV3ZnFxSTgwT2FCdWlzLTdTbXowcFRpUEUwOVZmcldIU3haVFJvRnNha3dkUmt3bXFUX2s3SDhiaVQ?oc=5&quot;&gt;Sri Lanka Guardian&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMirgFBVV95cUxPZlQyV2ZaU3ExUEJNeWpPNzJNSk82R2dhZXhTNEF1YklQLTRKUzNCbVBETTVMX0Y4Smxhb2VRWVFOTnFGS2w1VllvemVpdUo0Tmo4VWUyMk80Zkk5WlVjeGpQN3lBdFd6MWVNXzdFY3l5V2JTaEZMS1drelEwVjRoWXRMVGRtaHlmY1k3dGh1SDNROXRFNzl4YkpOSlgyN0xNcTR3M2l1UEZQRDJCWnc?oc=5&quot;&gt;The EastAfrican&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiuAFBVV95cUxOcXdJeDgzMFBMd05vTXFZWEpIZk1jcEZucTRHbTNfemZrdTBvSkFmMG1leGN0Y3FsTE1NWFF4ZHZpZ2FzTHpUaDh4ajBBN2RWYXlyYzM5RDVUODJjUHlwNFNsdnMtTnVHTDNRM0xYX3ExY0k1YkNfY0pZVHktYmt5eU5OVF82eW0xWmtqT2ZHVkV4Vm9FNndqVGF2Nm1mS3V0UjE2MFpjbHFwRTN3NENSenJidGRQTW5p?oc=5&quot;&gt;Hiiraan Online&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiqwFBVV95cUxOaVlWUUF6eFlzWmpVRDJkc09xYVRsSjdmbk9Na0NKS3M1RnpaMlZEbjU4aVRDSXNiQk9ZTmRxcWpQRmRINENMcUdIW